            "review_title": "Review at GẠO Vietnamese Kitchen",
            "review_text": "JojoBreda\nBreda, The Netherlands4002 contributions\n1\nGood price quality\nDec 2019 • Family\nStumbled by this restaurant in the afternoon and after looking on the menu we went back for dinner.\nWe were the only guests in a huge nice looking restaurant.\nNot surprised because it's low season and we always dine out late.\nOrdered rice noodles and they were sold out, no problem for us we be happy with steamed rice too.\nBàhn xeo one of the best i had in 3 weeks Vietnam, not greasy at all and very crispy.\nPrice quality 100 %.\nRead more\nWritten December 29, 2019\nGAOVIETNAMESEKITCHEN\nThank you for your nice comment. Hope to see you next time. Have a nice trip.\nWritten December 30, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
